cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Bounds in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Bounds"
abstract: >-
  A zero-LLM CLI that extracts a codebase's structural surface (exported symbols
  and cross-module imports) with tree-sitter and validates it against
  human-declared subsystem manifests, failing the build when the real source
  diverges from its intended architectural contract.
type: software
authors:
